  m_text: 'WASD/QE       Move selected simulated device

    H             Manipulate
    the head

    [ and ]       Select left/right controller

    Right mouse   Rotate

    G            
    Select / grip 3D objects

    T             UI trigger / activate

    Tab          
    Cycle controllers/hands

    K             Grab hand pose

    M            
    Pinch hand pose

    N             Poke hand pose

    O             Open hand

    P            
    Fist

    R             Reset simulator pose'
