--- !u!114 &1280101339
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1280101335}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a3f51d3d26f9aa142b0c0d2fdee5e108, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Team5.qPCR.Runtime::Team5.qPCR.NarrationController
  audioSource: {fileID: 1280101338}
  captionTexts:
  - {fileID: 1113781625}
  - {fileID: 205248495}
  captionTitles:
  - {fileID: 310641668}
  - {fileID: 2038384001}
  volumeSliders:
  - {fileID: 86193492}
  - {fileID: 1216893606}
  muteToggles:
  - {fileID: 1965095582}
  - {fileID: 295486249}
  replayButtons:
  - {fileID: 1409784356}
  - {fileID: 922282476}
  cues:
  - Key: TourLabCoat
    Caption: Point at and select the lab coat. The lab coat is part of personal protective
      equipment.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 653085a1ad019c14ca2505307fd86ab7, type: 3}
  - Key: TourGloves
    Caption: Select the blue nitrile gloves. Clean gloves reduce contamination and
      protect the learner.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d8f014c42fa5ec46b29c87226eaef59, type: 3}
  - Key: TourSink
    Caption: Select the laboratory sink. Hand hygiene comes before and after laboratory
      work.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d93399da41689a54f87646184fcf9056, type: 3}
  - Key: TourPreparedPlate
    Caption: Select the prepared qPCR plate. Team 5 receives a filled, mapped and
      sealed plate; it does not remix the reactions.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3c2f20e928cc4da40843a8d3e59ab30b, type: 3}
  - Key: TourOpticalSeal
    Caption: Select the transparent seal on top of the plate. The instrument reads
      fluorescence through this seal.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c9a064c62e0823a4f99ed9a0464e5132, type: 3}
  - Key: TourInstrument
    Caption: Select the real-time PCR machine. It changes temperature and measures
      fluorescence during the run.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5dbc5e885300fa4382c43a45d9b7b89, type: 3}
  - Key: TourTouchscreen
    Caption: Select the touchscreen. This is where the protocol is checked before
      loading.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3c155a5ab5d0bf34a8ce6a8c6d19efb8, type: 3}
  - Key: TourDrawer
    Caption: Select the plate drawer. The drawer carries the plate into the instrument.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 160d486396e9a8f458d164fa67549b8b, type: 3}
  - Key: TourThermalBlock
    Caption: Select the thermal block inside the drawer. The block performs denaturation,
      annealing and extension temperatures.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 51c9faf0c2e43944cbbf91c8f92607a5, type: 3}
  - Key: TourMonitor
    Caption: Select the monitor. Amplification curves and control results appear
      here.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ead5ba4cb8dc2ff46ae5aeea9cc7e585, type: 3}
  - Key: TourCentrifuge
    Caption: Select the plate centrifuge. It is background equipment in Team 5, but
      explains how liquid is collected before handoff.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 094def690e75fe24da0cb0cb3e4cf748, type: 3}
  - Key: TourWaste
    Caption: Select the biohazard waste container to finish the lab tour. Correct
      waste separation is part of safe laboratory work.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f21c39177b32a7d4bba42b96fc8e8bcb, type: 3}
  - Key: PowerOnInstrument
    Caption: Physically press the green Power button on the machine. The instrument
      must be powered before its controls unlock.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d46238b57c37d81428e51ed97097cb49, type: 3}
  - Key: ValidateProtocol
    Caption: Review the touchscreen values, correct any red field, then press Validate
      protocol. This teaching programme uses 35 cycles and fluorescence acquisition
      at 60 degrees Celsius.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 254e8aac7bf6c9945bc8111977058a6c, type: 3}
  - Key: InspectPlateId
    Caption: Select the plate ID label. The ID confirms the plate belongs to this
      run.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86db930409e0cef4d8b8522e92b35d5c, type: 3}
  - Key: InspectOpticalSeal
    Caption: Select the optical seal checkpoint. The seal must be intact and firmly
      attached.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4c96b73154b5f07418da92c4402045a7, type: 3}
  - Key: InspectBubbles
    Caption: Select the bubble-check area. Large bubbles can disturb the fluorescence
      reading.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e6096480d0f4c084d94f856eb664c6a6, type: 3}
  - Key: InspectA1Marker
    Caption: Select the A1 marker at the reference corner. A1 tells you which way
      the plate must face.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4fc228bce7b64b045b069e34d9e19499, type: 3}
  - Key: OpenDrawer
    Caption: Press the blue drawer-open button. The motorized drawer exposes the
      loading socket.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e3d552a2d7d69ab43aa248b4f60b1e98, type: 3}
  - Key: SeatPlate
    Caption: Pinch or grip the plate, align A1, and place it in the socket. Wrongly
      rotated plates are rejected and cannot snap into place.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49f84413c29f0e140a18e8d5dc258af6, type: 3}
  - Key: CloseDrawer
    Caption: Press the amber drawer-close button. The drawer only closes after the
      plate is correctly seated.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e5e99e45320534c45a6631deb2987df4, type: 3}
  - Key: StartRun
    Caption: Press the green Start button. Final scientific validation runs before
      the 35-cycle simulation begins.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 83f62141b502ae841bde8ef0be9f2ae7, type: 3}
  - Key: ObserveAmplification
    Caption: Watch the temperature, cycle counter and amplification curves build.
      The educational run is compressed to about 30 seconds.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6e7be9fe49276704f86c746eb4a771dc, type: 3}
  - Key: InterpretControlsPassed
    Caption: Choose the statement that correctly describes the positive control and
      NTC. The positive control must amplify. The no-template control must stay flat.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 721aa4d97efb9d64d9f3b2d8d77d9b34, type: 3}
  - Key: Complete
    Caption: Lesson complete. Review your time, mistakes and requested hints.
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 758ed5191de6ff847a869213c2402360, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &1280101340
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
